# N — the headroom magnitude does NOT scale N. x=0.5 → W=31, defaults floor5=50,
# ceil5=80, span=30. Hold used_5h=65 → h5=80-65=15 → N=round(8*15/30)=4 whenever
# the gate is open.
#   used_weekly=11 → hw=20 (open) → N=4
